        "y = \\frac{1}{5} \\left(\\right. 3 x^{2} + 4 \\left.\\right)^{5} + 1 ,",
        "\\\\ y^{'} & = \\left(\\right. \\frac{1}{5} \\left.\\right) 5 \\left(\\left(\\right. 3 x^{2} + 4 \\left.\\right)\\right)^{4} 6 x \\\\ & = 6 x \\left(\\left(\\right. 3 x^{2} + 4 \\left.\\right)\\right)^{4} ."
